featherbit terminal (fbterm) for Linux

This archive holds the same files as the .deb and .rpm packages:

  bin/fbterm                                  the program
  share/applications/fbterm.desktop           the app launcher entry
  share/icons/hicolor/<size>/apps/fbterm.png  the icon (32 to 512 px)

Install for your user only:

  install -Dm755 bin/fbterm ~/.local/bin/fbterm
  cp -r share/applications share/icons ~/.local/share/

Or for every user:

  sudo install -Dm755 bin/fbterm /usr/local/bin/fbterm
  sudo cp -r share/applications share/icons /usr/local/share/

fbterm needs a desktop session (Wayland or X11) with Vulkan or OpenGL (EGL)
graphics, and the xkbcommon library. Saved passwords use the desktop's
Secret Service when one is running; otherwise fbterm offers an encrypted vault.

Check the install with: fbterm --version
